@startuml
!include theme.iuml
title Retryable microphone capture and WAV staging
hide footbox
autonumber
actor Contributor
participant "app : App" as App
participant "recorder : Recorder" as Recorder
participant "sounddevice / InputStream\n<<external>>" as Device
participant "audio_utils\n<<module>>" as Audio
activate Contributor
Contributor -> App : toggle_recording() (Record)
activate App
App -> Audio : stop_playback()
activate Audio
Audio --> App : Stopped or AudioError
deactivate Audio
opt Playback stopped and recording capability exists
  App -> Recorder : start()
  activate Recorder
  Recorder -> Device : Open mono 44100 Hz InputStream; start()
  activate Device
  Device --> Recorder : Started stream or device error
  deactivate Device
  note over Recorder : On failure: recording=false, restore prior frames;\nclose partial stream, retaining handle if close fails.
  Recorder --> App : Started or AudioError
  deactivate Recorder
end
App --> Contributor : Stop/Recording, or explicit retryable error
deactivate App
opt Stream started
  loop Captured frames while recording=true
    activate Device
    Device -> Recorder : callback(indata, ...)
    activate Recorder
    note over Recorder : Copy incoming samples into frames.
    Recorder --> Device : Callback returns
    deactivate Recorder
    deactivate Device
  end
end
note over App, Device : Callbacks run on the device thread between GUI events;\nthey are not a blocking call from the GUI.
opt Capture started or stop/close retry is pending
Contributor -> App : toggle_recording() (Stop / Retry stop)
activate App
App -> Recorder : stop()
activate Recorder
opt Stream handle exists
Recorder -> Device : stop(); close() in finally
activate Device
Device --> Recorder : Closed or device error
deactivate Device
end
note over Recorder : recording=false; clear stream only after close succeeds.\nRetain frames so stop/concatenation can be retried.
Recorder --> App : Samples / no samples / AudioError
deactivate Recorder
alt Stop failed
  note over App : Retry stop; keep draft and frames.
else No samples
  note over App : No new file; preserve any previous attachment.
else Samples available
  App -> Audio : save_recording(samples, AUDIO_DIR)
  activate Audio
  note over Audio : Sibling WAV write, then atomic publication;\nremove an incomplete temporary file on failure.
  Audio --> App : Generated filename or AudioError
  deactivate Audio
  alt Write failed
    note over App : Retain captured array; offer Retry audio save.
  else Write succeeded
    note over App : Stage filename and release captured-array retry state;\nonly draft-owned superseded media may be removed.
  end
end
App --> Contributor : Truthful status and synchronized controls
deactivate App
end
deactivate Contributor
legend bottom
  Device activation spans each callback delivery interval below the start request.
  Save, attach and playback are blocked while audio remains unfinished.
  Retry audio save calls save_recording again without opening the microphone.
  Clear/close deliberately discard draft-owned audio; saved recordings survive.
endlegend
@enduml
